        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium hydroxide, plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium hydroxide, plant
Medium sized plant. Output: 1'220'000 t/a, life time: 50 years;
UUID: b75107d6-f03c-3059-880c-e6af17f80994
Part of the Al2O3 plant needed for Al(OH)3 fabrication including port, storage and process infrastructure. Also includes Building for administration. Includes disposal.
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Technology of one medium sized plant in Germany
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Internet search 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is adjusted for geographical mismatch (using the pedigree matrix).
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b75107d6-f03c-3059-880c-e6af17f80994.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
